stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued: publish (validated)
  queued --> building: runner picks the job (one per site at a time)
  building --> gating: export read, pages rendered
  gating --> deploying: every gate passed
  gating --> failed: any gate failed (nothing deployed)
  building --> failed: export refused / render error
  deploying --> done: deployed + smoke test passed
  deploying --> failed: deploy or smoke failed (previous deploy stays live)
  queued --> failed: timeout 30 min
  done --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
